<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>ideal</span><span class='word-fr-box'>l'idéal<span class='fr-pos-m'>n.m.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 ideal</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/ai'diәl/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/ideal/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('ideal', 'l\'idéal')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 理想, 典范, 观念, 思想, 最后目标</td><td class='def-en'>the idea of something that is perfect; something that one hopes to attain</td><td>4.44</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“The case highlighted the significance of ideal (the idea of something that is perfect).”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> idea</div></div></td></tr>
