<tr><td class='word'><span class='word-en-box'>fancy</span><span class='word-fr-box'>la fantaisie<span class='fr-pos-f'>n.f.</span><span class='en-sub-hint'>🇬🇧 fancy</span></span></td><td class='phonetic'><span class='ph-en-text'>/'fænsi/</span><span class='ph-fr-text'>/fɑ̃tezi/</span> <button class='audio-btn' onclick="playWord('fancy', 'la fantaisie')" title='播放发音'>🔊</button></td><td>n. 想象力, 幻想, 喜好</td><td class='def-en'>something many people believe that is false</td><td>4.35</td><td><div class='ctx-box'><div class='ctx-ex'>“they have the illusion that I am very wealthy”</div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>同义:</b> <span class='syn-tag'>illusion</span><span class='syn-tag'>fantasy</span><span class='syn-tag'>phantasy</span></div><div class='ctx-syn'><b>上位概念:</b> misconception</div></div></td></tr>
